= Instructions

Frost the rim of a #Margarita glass{} using @Water{} and @Sugar{}.

Combine all ingredients in a blender: @White rum{1 1/2 oz}, @Lime juice{1/2 oz}, 
frozen @Strawberries{5-6} (can substitute raspberries), @Simple syrup{1/3 oz}, @Ice{} cubes.

Blend until smooth.

Pour into the margarita glass.